otype-font="Segoe UI;7;I" stereotype-horizontal-alignment="center" stereotype-vertical-alignment="center" /></item><item id="di217814299327783514" iid="bb979595f59443f98382857722a2ad23" name="Texto13" show-cid="false" show-parent-name="false" show-stereotypes="true" show-tagged-values="false" creation-date="11/09/2026 12:28:52" order-index="13" type="drawing-text"><layout ax="1980" ay="104" awidth="16" aheight="7" x="1980" y="104" width="16" height="7" angle="0" /><drawing-text><text /></drawing-text><style background-type="solid" background-color="#FFFDF0F0" background-color2="#FFFDF0F0" border-color="#FFA03C3C" border-width="1" shadow-type="smooth" shadow-offset="-2,-2" shadow-size="6,6" shadow-visible="false" shadow-color="#50000000" shadow-radius="6" gloss-effect="false" threed-gloss-effect="false" wrap-name-text="true" wrap-other-text="false" text-wrapping-threshold="0" padding="2" name-color="#FF1B1B1B" name-font="Segoe UI;9;B" name-horizontal-alignment="center" name-vertical-alignment="center" part-header-color="#FF1E1E1E" part-header-font="Segoe UI;7;I" part-header-horizontal-alignment="center" part-header-vertical-alignment="center" text-color="#FF1A1A1A" text-font="Segoe UI;7.5;" text-horizontal-alignment="left" text-vertical-alignment="center" tagged-value-color="#FF1E1E1E" tagged-value-font="Segoe UI;7;I" tagged-value-horizontal-alignment="center" tagged-value-vertical-alignment="center" stereotype-color="#FF555555" stereotype-font="Segoe UI;7;I" stereotype-horizontal-alignment="center" stereotype-vertical-alignment="center" /></item><item id="di495032227314573653" iid="7aa3a3d7171a4d6c810bc8852c6aed65" name="Texto14" show-cid="false" show-parent-name="false" show-stereotypes="true" show-tagged-values="false" creation-date="11/09/2026 12:28:52" order-index="14" type="drawing-text"><layout ax="40" ay="1037" awidth="480" aheight="190" x="40" y="1037" width="480" height="190" angle="0" /><drawing-text><text>Nomenclatura aplicada (estándar del curso):
· Clases: PascalCase  →  UsuarioModelo, ConexionBd
· Atributos y variables: camelCase → nombreCompleto
· Métodos y funciones: verbo + camelCase →
   buscarPorCorreo(), generarHashClave()
· Constantes: MAYÚSCULAS → MENSAJE_LOGIN_FALLIDO
· Tablas/columnas BD: camelCase → tokenRecuperacion
· Todo en español; nombres que dicen QUÉ hacen.</text></drawing-text><style background-type="solid" background-color="#FFFFFBE6" background-color2="#FFFFFBE6" border-color="#FFC9B458" border-width="1" shadow-type="smooth" shadow-offset="-2,-2" shadow-size="6,6" shadow-visible="false" shadow-color="#50000000" shadow-radius="6" gloss-effect="false" threed-gloss-effect="false" wrap-name-text="true" wrap-other-text="true" text-wrapping-threshold="0" padding="2" name-color="#FF1B1B1B" name-font="Segoe UI;9;B" name-horizontal-alignment="center" name-vertical-alignment="center" part-header-color="#FF1E1E1E" part-header-font="Segoe UI;7;I" part-header-horizontal-alignment="center" part-header-vertical-alignment="center" text-color="#FF5A4A00" text-font="Segoe UI;7.5;" text-horizontal-alignment="left" text-vertical-alignment="top" tagged-value-color="#FF1E1E1E" tagged-value-font="Segoe UI;7;I" tagged-value-horizontal-alignment="center" tagged-value-vertical-alignment="center" stereotype-color="#FF555555" stereotype-font="Segoe UI;7;I" stereotype-horizontal-alignment="center" stereotype-vertical-alignment="center" /></item><item id="di405243917317023845" iid="be7740c5544644e3b252f740692a85a2" name="Texto15" show-cid="false" show-parent-name="false" show-stereotypes="true" show-tagged-values="false" creation-date="11/09/2026 12:28:52" order-index="15" type="drawing-text"><layout ax="1760" ay="1037" awidth="400" aheight="190" x="1760" y="1037" width="400" height="190" angle="0" /><drawing-text><text>Patrón de las clases del Modelo:
· Entidad (Usuario): solo datos.
· Modelo (UsuarioModelo): el SQL de UNA
   tabla, con parámetros «?» (sin inyección).
· Heredan de ConexionBd: abrir/cerrar
   conexión se escribe una sola vez.
· La clave se guarda como hash BCrypt;
   el token como hash SHA-256.</text></drawing-text><style background-type="solid" background-color="#FFFFFBE6" background-color2="#FFFFFBE6" border-color="#FFC9B458" border-width="1" shadow-type="smooth" shadow-offset="-2,-2" shadow-size="6,6" shadow-visible="false" shadow-color="#50000000" shadow-radius="6" gloss-effect="false" threed-gloss-effect="false" wrap-name-text="true" wrap-other-text="true" text-wrapping-threshold="0" padding="2" name-color="#FF1B1B1B" name-font="Segoe UI;9;B" name-horizontal-alignment="center" name-vertical-alignment="center" part-header-color="#FF1E1E1E" part-header-font="Segoe UI;7;I" part-header-horizontal-alignment="center" part-header-vertical-alignment="center" text-color="#FF5A4A00" text-font="Segoe UI;7.5;" text-horizontal-alignment="left" text-vertical-alignment="top" tagged-value-color="#FF1E1E1E" tagged-value-font="Segoe UI;7;I" tagged-value-horizontal-alignment="center" tagged-value-vertical-alignment="center" stereotype-color="#FF555555" stereotype-font="Segoe UI;7;I" stereotype-horizontal-alignment="center" stereotype-vertical-alignment="center" /></item><item id="di743417539090246302" iid="37e59f33c41b4e1d9413c9a2dc412469" show-cid="false" show-parent-name="false" show-stereotypes="true" show-tagged-values="false" creation-date="11/09/2026 12:28:52" order-index="16" type="entity"><layout ax="470" ay="175" awidth="620" aheight="204" x="470" y="175" width="620" height="204" angle="0" /><class /><style background-type="solid" background-color="#FFFFF4E5" background-color2="#FFFFF4E5" border-color="#FFC96A12" border-width="1" shadow-type="smooth" shadow-offset="-2,-2" shadow-size="6,6" shadow-visible="false" shadow-color="#50000000" shadow-radius="6" gloss-effect="false" threed-gloss-effect="false" wrap-name-text="true" wrap-other-text="false" text-wrapping-threshold="0" padding="2" name-color="#FF1B1B1B" name-font="Segoe UI;9.8;B" name-horizontal-alignment="center" name-vertical-alignment="center" part-header-color="#FF1E1E1E